# Real-Life Example

Imagine making coffee.

Taste depends on

* Coffee Powder (x)
* Milk (y)

Formula

```text
Taste = x² + y²
```

### Partial derivative with respect to x

Increase only the coffee powder.

Keep milk fixed.

Result

```
2x
```

---

### Partial derivative with respect to y

Increase only the milk.

Keep coffee powder fixed.

Result

```
2y
```

